WEBVTT

00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:04.870
In order to take over
the Karasumori Site.

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:07.770
The Kokuboro have declared war
on Yoshimori and the others

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.970
by sending in Ayakashi
wearing human skin.

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:16.640
In their first battle against the Kokuboro's
bizarre and tremendous power,

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:18.710
Yoshimori and the others
were severely hurt

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:20.650
in a difficult battle unlike any
they had experienced before.

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:34.190
They barely won.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:37.130
Then a man named Hiba
of the Night Troops appeared

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:41.090
to inform them that Gen will be removed
from his post at Karasumori.

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:45.160
Did you know?

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:47.110
His sister was...

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:48.110
Stop!

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:48.940
Shishio!

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:49.930
Gen-kun!

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:51.430
I'm going back...

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:58.750
Sumimura Yoshimori.
A junior high student,

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:00.860
and Yukimura Tokine.
A high school student,

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:03.290
must guard the land where
their school now stands.

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:06.230
To protect the Karasumori Site
from the Ayakashi.

00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:09.720
It is a duty passed down to them
from generation to generation.

00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:15.700
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:17.570
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:22.780
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:01:22.780 --> 00:01:24.680
(Fighting late into the night)

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:28.120
Drive away all hesitation

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:32.520
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:36.060
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:39.390
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:39.390 --> 00:01:45.060
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:49.560
Sha la la la la...

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:55.980
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:57.950
(Secret romance)

00:01:57.950 --> 00:02:03.150
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:02:03.150 --> 00:02:04.910
(A strange distance)

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:11.760
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:12.830
Yeah

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:16.300
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:19.900
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:25.240
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:08.940
Why Shishio?

00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:11.950
Karasumori is the Chief's hometown. Isn't it?

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:14.710
Why send him somewhere
so important?

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:17.950
He went berserk again the other day
and had to be restrained.

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:19.590
He's nothing but trouble!

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:22.190
He'll probably mess up and
get sent back real quick.

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:24.960
Oh. Man. I know I could do
better than him.

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:34.800
The view is pretty good up here.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:43.940
Um... Ch-Chief...

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:48.080
This mission at Karasumori. I...

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:53.950
I used to hate Karasumori
back in the day.

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:57.600
But ever since I left.
It's been on my mind...

00:03:58.570 --> 00:03:59.970
I wonder why.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:03.330
Does it mean that it's important
to me after all?

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:08.370
An organization of Ayakashi
is after Karasumori now.

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:13.670
It'll be a big help if you can
protect Karasumori until I can go.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:19.210
I think you're perfect for this job.

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:21.540
Chief...

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:23.580
You can do it, right?

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:27.960
Pack your things.

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:53.920
Did you know?
His sister was...

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:57.220
What happened to him?

00:04:58.930 --> 00:05:01.330
I'm not gonna let him go like this!

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:07.670
Shishio-kun? He was here earlier.
But went home.

00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:08.670
He went home?

00:05:08.670 --> 00:05:11.870
He said he wasn't feeling well,
but I think he wanted to ditch class.

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:14.540
So he escaped, huh?

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:39.420
I found the big-shot
who's backing the traitor.

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:44.790
Bingo.

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:46.440
Bingo?

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:48.530
He just called me over.

00:05:49.480 --> 00:05:51.070
Probably going to lecture me
about something.

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:55.780
Wait! You're going to meet him
in that outfit?

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:57.010
Are you stupid?

00:05:57.450 --> 00:05:59.890
I hope he thinks so too.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.250
I hope you don't get yourself killed.

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:19.070
You should know why
you were summoned here.

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:24.540
It seems that your dealings with
Karasumori are not proceeding well.

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:28.140
As of now. There haven't
been any problems.

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:31.250
Don't think I haven't heard.

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:34.720
Sending that inexperienced
Half-Ayakashi child...

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:37.280
It was obvious he was going
to lose control.

00:06:38.090 --> 00:06:39.920
Gen is doing very well.

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:42.920
I had posted some backup there,

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:46.060
they've been keeping watch
for quite a while now.

00:06:46.570 --> 00:06:49.870
They are working
under my direct orders.

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:53.710
Perhaps you weren't aware of this.

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:01.140
Besides. There are dedicated
Kekkaishi for that site.

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:04.050
There's no need for the Shadow
Organization to get involved.

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:08.420
I would like you to leave me
in charge of this matter.

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:10.920
And you'll take full responsibility?

00:07:11.390 --> 00:07:12.050
Yes.

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:16.430
If there is nothing else,
I will now excuse myself.

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:21.120
You!

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:25.700
That crest on your back!

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:28.310
The identity of the Council of Twelve
must be kept secret!

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:29.900
You must know the law!

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:33.480
I do. But that's not a law.
It's merely a custom.

00:07:33.880 --> 00:07:36.440
There is no punishment
for breaking it.

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:40.350
Exposing myself might make me
an easier target,

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:42.410
but I shouldn't be an executive member
if I'm afraid of such a thing.

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:43.680
You fool!

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:54.330
Don't push your luck, kid.

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:58.010
Don't forget that council seats
become vacant

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:00.870
due to the untimely
deaths of its members.

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:02.540
You don't have to worry.

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:05.140
I won't disobey the council.

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:09.810
That would defeat the purpose
of becoming a member myself.

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:28.240
Damn it! I couldn't block
all of his strikes.

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:31.070
As expected of a top executive...

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:34.100
From the Ogi clan of Wind Masters!

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:41.350
Yoshimori!

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:45.550
Hey, Yoshi.
It's rare for you to be so early.

00:08:48.320 --> 00:08:51.050
Where's Gen-kun?
He's not here, I guess.

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:52.230
I don't know.

00:08:52.230 --> 00:08:53.820
Be honest.

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:56.100
You came early to wait for him.

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:57.090
Shut up!

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.630
You're blushing!

00:08:58.630 --> 00:09:02.770
Hakubi thinks Gen-kun is able
to control himself

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:06.470
because of his strong willpower and
rigorous training.

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:08.600
Right?

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:11.440
Probably. A coward can't
possibly do what he can.

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:15.910
Someone like that would
never abandon his mission.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:17.750
Well. I know...

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:21.610
It's here!

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:23.320
Let's go!

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:24.310
Yeah!

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:29.850
Over there!

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:31.720
What is that thing?

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:34.340
It's a Hazemukuri.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.570
What a slow Ayakashi!

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:38.600
Well. I don't know about that.

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:42.600
Just watch!
I'll take care of that in an instant.

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:44.170
Hoi! Joso!

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:46.170
Ketsu!

00:09:47.550 --> 00:09:48.540
What?!

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:51.150
What is this?!

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:52.140
What?!

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:55.650
That hurt! Why you...

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:58.850
Yoshimori!

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:01.690
You're so clumsy!

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:03.420
Strike!

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:06.330
Damn!

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:08.130
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.400
It's too fast! I can't surround it!

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:17.550
What are you going to do, Yoshi?

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:20.880
At this rate, Karasumori is getting
so many holes it'll look like Swiss cheese.

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:24.880
Fine! Then I'll surround
the entire school!

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:26.350
What are you talking about?!

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:27.910
Are you going to cast Metsu
on the school?

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:32.690
What should I do?!

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:34.800
Geez. You're so pitiful.

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:37.500
It's just a Hazemukuri.
Do it quick.

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:38.560
Don't say it like it's easy!

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:41.540
It is easy.
Just attack its weak point.

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:43.500
Its weak point?
Where is it?!

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:45.200
I wonder.

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:48.910
If you know, just tell me!

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:51.100
Oh, my. You're so rough.

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:53.980
I'll turn you into dog stew!

00:10:54.450 --> 00:10:56.350
Don't get mad and think about it.

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:59.180
It only has a head and a body.

00:10:59.790 --> 00:11:03.990
A Kekkaishi should be able to
see its weak point.

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:06.160
Uh... The head?

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:08.350
If you think so,
then go ahead and try.

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:11.850
All right.

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:16.000
Wait! I have to find it
among all those?!

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:17.200
We have to do it!

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:21.500
But how do we surround it?

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:25.010
If Gen-kun was here
he could keep up with its speed.

00:11:27.050 --> 00:11:28.040
It has antennae!

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:29.580
It's that one!

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:30.980
I'll do it! Ketsu!

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:46.560
Shishio...

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:52.340
Hey! Wait!

00:11:54.340 --> 00:11:56.280
I'll do my job until
I'm relieved of my post.

00:11:57.780 --> 00:11:58.680
Gen-kun!

00:11:58.680 --> 00:11:59.670
Don't run away!

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:01.270
Hey!

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:06.010
He's reverted back to
the way he was when we met him.

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:10.790
He showed up for his job,

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:13.230
but he doesn't seem to be cooperating
with them as their assistant.

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:17.130
This will cause problems for the mission,
we should switch him out soon...

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:22.530
Yes. Of course.
I beat him without mercy.

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:26.370
Now, your younger brother
really hates me, Chief.

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:29.400
Don't start complaining.

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:32.910
I can think a little further ahead
than you because I'm older.

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:37.480
I don't mind.
But I do hate Shishio.

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:41.220
That's why I'm the best suited
to watch him, right?

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:44.620
Anyway, continue with the surveillance.

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:47.220
I don't care if you are harsh on Gen.

00:12:50.430 --> 00:12:53.090
Now then...
Next is Yoshimori...

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:04.140
I want Gen-kun to stay
at Karasumori too. But...

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:07.980
It's not that I want him to stay.

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:10.110
Oh? You're just putting up a front.

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:13.240
Despite everything you say,
you like him and you know it.

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:18.490
Shut up! I owe him one!
I need to repay him!

00:13:19.030 --> 00:13:20.190
You owe him. Huh?

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:24.300
But he looks like
he's all ready to leave.

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:25.730
And he's acting meek or something.

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:28.970
He says that he won't abandon
his mission. But...

00:13:29.900 --> 00:13:31.270
He really should fight it.

00:13:32.810 --> 00:13:33.800
Yeah...

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:39.180
That Hiba from the Night Troops
said a lot of stuff about Shishio.

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:42.640
Something about his sister and family...

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:46.980
That really bothered me,
I keep wondering what happened...

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:52.780
I want to know too.
But Gen-kun would never tell us about it.

00:13:53.230 --> 00:13:57.660
Even if I asked someone else.
No one really knows him.

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:04.500
Him...

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:08.500
We can never get through
to Gen-kun...

00:14:09.140 --> 00:14:12.170
He puts up an emotional wall
and it's like he pushes us away.

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:16.410
Even with a wall between us.
We have to cooperate with each other!

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:19.450
I don't know what that wall is. But...

00:14:20.590 --> 00:14:22.080
I'm going to ask my brother.

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:24.010
Yoshimori are you?

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:37.130
Dad. Um...

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:40.370
What is it. Yoshimori?

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.710
Can you tell me...

00:14:43.140 --> 00:14:44.130
Tell you what?

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:47.380
Big Brother's cell number...

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:57.860
Damn it!

00:14:59.990 --> 00:15:01.990
It's not easy jumping over walls!

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:14.200
Hi... It's me...

00:15:14.280 --> 00:15:15.770
The person you are trying
to reach is unavailable.

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:17.170
Please leave a message.

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:20.850
Damn stupid brother!

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:23.320
That's horrible.
"Damn stupid brother" huh?

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:30.080
Wh-Why are you here?!

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:32.220
Why? This is my home.

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:37.060
Big Bro Masa! Dad!
It's Masa! He's back!

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:41.570
Welcome home. Masa!

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:43.700
Masamori, what happened?
This is sudden!

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:47.330
I just felt like having
your home cooking, Dad.

00:15:47.370 --> 00:15:50.540
You should have called me earlier.

00:15:54.580 --> 00:15:56.640
I have returned. Grandfather.

00:15:57.080 --> 00:16:00.650
Yes. I'm glad you are home.
We'll speak later.

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:02.620
Yes...

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:05.860
It's tempura!

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:09.730
Now. Let's eat.

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:11.100
- Let's eat!
- Let's eat!

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:18.610
The crunchy batter, the perfect texture
of the shrimp, exquisite!

00:16:18.610 --> 00:16:20.570
This is superb, Shuji-san!

00:16:21.140 --> 00:16:23.700
Oh, really?
That's very nice to hear.

00:16:23.780 --> 00:16:25.440
I love shrimp tempura!

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:27.850
Hey, you're eating nothing but shrimp.

00:16:27.850 --> 00:16:29.120
Eat the sweet potatoes, too.

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:31.310
You're eating nothing but shrimp, too.

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:33.290
Leave some for your brother!

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:35.810
Shut up!
Can't you eat quietly?!

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:41.020
If I knew you were coming
I would've made your favorites.

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:45.930
I'm happy to be eating tempura
after coming back on short notice.

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:47.860
The meals over there are very plain.

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:51.400
Are you eating well?
You look thinner.

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:53.840
Really? I don't think
I've really changed.

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:57.000
His annoying personality
hasn't changed a bit either.

00:16:57.340 --> 00:16:58.870
Here. Eat this.

00:16:59.150 --> 00:17:00.140
This. Too.

00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:03.050
Dad looks so happy having
Big Brother Masa home.

00:17:03.650 --> 00:17:07.310
I love eating meals with a lot of people.

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:09.980
Speaking of which, Yoshimori.

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:12.920
When is Shishio-kun
coming over for dinner?

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:17.960
You should invite him.
Since Masamori is back. Too.

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:20.130
It'll be fun to have a meal together.

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:21.960
Sounds like a great idea.

00:17:23.300 --> 00:17:27.830
Hey! We're not in a situation where
we can enjoy a meal with Shishio!

00:17:31.310 --> 00:17:33.440
I'm going to create a wall after all!

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:42.150
I heard you became an executive
in the Shadow Organization.

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:45.460
Yes. I am the Seventh Seat in
the Council of Twelve.

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:47.820
I told you not to become too involved.

00:17:48.100 --> 00:17:50.500
Is this how you keep your distance?

00:17:50.800 --> 00:17:53.890
I do keep my distance.
Within my heart.

00:17:54.370 --> 00:17:55.730
Don't split hairs!

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:58.770
Do you understand
what you have done?

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:01.040
I understand full well
what it entails.

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:03.840
Silence!
You made a fool out of me!

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:07.240
And why did you send an underling
as an assistant without asking me first?!

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:09.440
Are you trying to defile Karasumori?

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:14.790
My position as an executive will be
in danger if I don't protect Karasumori.

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:16.680
Sounds like an idea!

00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:19.160
Why don't you just get fired
from that Council!

00:18:20.760 --> 00:18:26.200
The Shadow Organization intends to rid
Karasumori of us and take over themselves.

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:28.440
In order to monitor them.

00:18:28.440 --> 00:18:30.800
Placing myself on the Council
was a necessary move.

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:36.170
Grandfather.
You must have suspected that.

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:39.880
Isn't that why you told me not to get involved
with the Shadow Organization, right?

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:42.750
That's right!
I told you not to get involved.

00:18:42.750 --> 00:18:46.090
I didn't tell you to be
some secret agent!

00:18:46.090 --> 00:18:48.080
I haven't heard "secret agent"
in a long time.

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:49.890
At least call me a "spy."

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:52.180
Don't try to change the subject!

00:18:52.890 --> 00:18:55.090
I'll apologize for
not doing as I'm told.

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:58.720
But this is my way of
protecting Karasumori.

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:00.290
Please understand.

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:05.370
Is that all?
What are you really thinking?

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:07.700
Nothing at all...

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:13.740
You may die, Masamori.

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:19.220
I am not the Legitimate Heir.
I am not bound to Karasumori.

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:20.690
I have no duty to fulfill.

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:23.350
That's why I can risk my life like this.

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:25.620
Masamori...

00:19:28.030 --> 00:19:30.220
I'm the perfect person for this job.

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:44.040
Dad. Where's Big Brother?

00:19:44.440 --> 00:19:46.670
Masamori?
Isn't he in his room?

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:47.740
Oh.

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:03.290
What is it. Yoshimori?

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:07.470
What have you been doing?

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:08.760
Wh-What?!

00:20:08.900 --> 00:20:10.370
Is there something
you want from me?

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:11.560
Why would I?

00:20:12.070 --> 00:20:15.100
Oh? But you called
your "damn stupid brother" earlier.

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:16.640
Damn stupid brother!

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:22.880
That's a phone call from hell!

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:25.610
Is this about Gen?

00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:32.380
It's why he can't leave yet.

00:20:32.760 --> 00:20:33.420
Oh?

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:35.320
It's not like it's something big
that I owe him...

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:36.830
It's not a big deal...

00:20:37.060 --> 00:20:41.560
But I did survive because of him...

00:20:41.940 --> 00:20:44.300
Oh? I'll think about it...

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:46.530
Is that all?

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:47.900
N-No...

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:49.700
So...

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:55.140
There's that Hiba guy
from the Night Troops...

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:57.440
The one watching over Shishio.

00:20:57.820 --> 00:20:58.480
Yeah.

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:04.750
He talked about Shishio. About his sister
and being abandoned by his family.

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:06.820
Oh. That.

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:09.090
So you know about it!

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:12.430
What happened?
What did Shishio do?

00:21:12.770 --> 00:21:13.820
Why do you want to know?

00:21:14.530 --> 00:21:16.930
Why? I don't know...

00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:18.330
Then I can't tell you.

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:19.730
Why not?

00:21:19.810 --> 00:21:22.380
You can't shoulder the weight
of someone's past

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:24.280
if you're only asking out
of casual interest.

00:21:24.440 --> 00:21:26.540
That's not for you to decide,
Big Brother!

00:21:30.920 --> 00:21:33.490
He never looks at me.
He never looks me in the eye.

00:21:33.490 --> 00:21:34.580
He never listens to me.

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:36.650
I can't stand it!

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:39.530
You're just throwing a tantrum.

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:41.450
No! I...

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:46.130
I feel like there are walls
around him like Kekkai.

00:21:46.670 --> 00:21:50.160
As long as they're there,
he won't think of us as friends.

00:21:50.970 --> 00:21:53.440
I want to break that wall.

00:21:53.670 --> 00:21:57.240
You think you can break it
if you learn about Gen's past?

00:21:57.240 --> 00:21:58.800
I don't know!

00:21:59.180 --> 00:22:01.340
I don't know what I don't know!

00:22:01.550 --> 00:22:03.680
Am I not allowed to ask
because I don't know?!

00:22:04.080 --> 00:22:05.850
You're not making sense...

00:22:05.850 --> 00:22:06.840
You got a problem with that?!

00:22:06.890 --> 00:22:07.880
Calm down.

00:22:08.160 --> 00:22:09.560
Fine! I'm going!

00:22:09.560 --> 00:22:11.220
Wait. Sit down.

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:13.880
No. You're just going to
lecture me again.

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:17.020
That's not it.
It's going to be a long story.

00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:22.300
Gen nearly killed his own sister.

00:22:46.190 --> 00:22:49.890
With a look on your face that says,
"I'm doing this for you"

00:22:49.930 --> 00:22:53.160
While being enthusiastic
across the table

00:22:53.300 --> 00:22:57.330
Why do you only tell me
dark predictions?

00:22:57.470 --> 00:23:00.930
It's a meaningless
use of language.

00:23:01.170 --> 00:23:04.740
Trying to avoid an emergency,
nothing's gonna happen

00:23:04.880 --> 00:23:08.710
I can't learn anything
(What's going on?)

00:23:08.750 --> 00:23:12.780
You're not bearing
the brunt of my future

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:16.050
I am, it's common sense

00:23:16.090 --> 00:23:20.390
I can't go anywhere
if I'm always weak

00:23:20.430 --> 00:23:26.370
Train me so hard until I cry

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:32.700
If you're gonna complain that
tough times are heading our way

00:23:32.740 --> 00:23:34.670
(if that's true)

00:23:34.710 --> 00:23:39.370
Please don't baby me
any more than you need to

00:23:39.510 --> 00:23:42.810
Please Please Please

00:23:42.850 --> 00:23:47.010
Even if I bleed
I'll get a hold of the wisdom

00:23:47.050 --> 00:23:50.350
To stand firm in
this unstable world

00:23:50.390 --> 00:23:54.620
You watch from far away

00:23:54.660 --> 00:24:00.620
It's strange that
I want to hold you

00:24:01.440 --> 00:24:02.730
Hey Hey
